ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260530/202605300505492484_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260530/202605300505492484_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【巴萨官宣戈登】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19af364561dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">今夏首签！官方：巴萨签下25岁英格兰前锋戈登，总价超8000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a185b7394018.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a185b7394018.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a185b7394018.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨官方宣布，从纽卡签下25岁的英格兰前锋戈登，双方签约5年。据悉，戈登转会费为7000万欧基础+浮动，总价超8000万欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19ee7ae65d5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">戈登：我风格类似拉菲尼亚 巴萨是世界最佳而我会西语就因儿萨梦</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19ff024c7a5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">图片报：拜仁最多愿为戈登出6000万，巴萨报价8000万纽卡接受分期</a></p><p><strong>【马竞连续发文回击巴萨】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a19b577f23cenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">回击巴萨签小蜘蛛传闻！马竞社媒：HWG，我们以4张门票报价亚马尔</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.85" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605292349325165.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.85" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.85" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605292349325165.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605292349325165.jpg"> </div><p>马竞官方社媒发文，宣布将签下亚马尔，以回应巴萨尝试签下阿尔瓦雷斯的传闻。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a19b784274f5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一次三个！马竞官方连晒亚马尔、佩德里、拉菲HWG图 回击转会传闻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.71" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260530/202605300005384683.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.71" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.71" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260530/202605300005384683_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260530/202605300005384683_720.jpg"> </div><p>马竞官方在X平台先后晒亚马尔、佩德里和拉菲尼亚HWG图，回击近期关于巴萨、阿尔瓦雷斯的传闻。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19b937dccd3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">第二波来袭！马竞官方晒佩德里图：加价到6张门票，here we go！</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19bc3c9cd88native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞官方晒拉菲HWG图：租借1个赛季！别轻信你看到的，尤其是巴萨</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19dea0cb9c9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞回应：我们对巴萨积怨已久 想签小蜘蛛需付5亿欧解约金</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260205/6984b42c13bf0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260205/6984b42c13bf0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260205/6984b42c13bf0.jpg"> </div><p>马竞连发多条社媒回击巴萨，他们也通过世体对自己的做法进行了解释。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19b9fee8ac3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">杠上了！马竞社媒：不要轻信眼见之物，尤其是和巴萨相关的内容</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19c4de68254native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞社媒再发文：最后，我们断然否认邀请德科去巴西当球探</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19c853d4180native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞官方：巴萨持续诽谤我们的1名球员 我们不会收买裁判和找关系</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19d53dc09a6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">还没完！马竞官方再晒巴萨是狗视频：当巴萨尝试签下你的球员</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19be19d4799native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">事主冷静吃瓜！罗马诺转发马竞HWG亚马尔图：这是马竞官方的声明</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a19c861e4034native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">最疯官号？盘点马竞社媒：HWG巴萨3将，嘲讽巴萨是狗，炮轰判罚</a></p><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/match1986219date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">时隔1年重回意甲！蒙扎0-2总分2-2卡坦萨罗 因联赛排名高惊险升级</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260530/202605300407168715.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260530/202605300407168715.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260530/202605300407168715.jpg"> </div><p>蒙扎主场0-2不敌卡坦萨罗，总比分蒙扎2-2卡坦萨罗。蒙扎因意乙联赛排名更高惊险升级，时隔一年重回意甲。</p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-30/6a1a070777cd0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">太阳报：31岁斯特林涉嫌毒驾被捕，球员已获保释将接受进一步调查</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.85" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260530/202605300550023300.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.85" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.85" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260530/202605300550023300.jpg" alt="